WEBVTT

00:03:57.968 --> 00:04:00.903
We like to build things.

00:04:00.903 --> 00:04:07.290
Then we like to take things apart.

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:09.406
We make things grow.

00:04:09.406 --> 00:04:11.208
We make things glow.

00:04:11.208 --> 00:04:15.175
And we make cells dance.

00:04:15.175 --> 00:04:18.966
The spirit of these labs, it's open, it's positive,

00:04:18.966 --> 00:04:21.407
but, you know, sometimes when people think of us,

00:04:21.407 --> 00:04:25.434
the first thing that comes to mind is bio-safety,

00:04:25.434 --> 00:04:28.511
bio-security, all the dark side stuff.

00:04:28.511 --> 00:04:31.119
I'm not going to minimize those concerns.